  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level and every 4 levels thereafter, the multiple master gains a bonus feat in addition to those gained from normal advancement. These bonus feats must be selected from those listed as teamwork feats. Of particular note, clones count as separate characters who possess the same teamwork feat for the purpose of activating the benefits of the feats.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/multiple-master#toc14\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
